    text: "Affected direction: Westbound\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nErie Community Center (#33200)\r\nErie Pkwy & Meller St (#33246)\r\nSouth Boulder Rd & Saratoga Dr (#22308)\r\nSouth Boulder Rd & Robin Hood St (#22301)\r\nErie Pkwy & Brennan St (#33247)\r\n119th St & Meadow Sweet Farm Pkwy (#33248)\r\nSir Galahad Dr & South Boulder Rd (#17906)\r\nMerlin Dr & E Spaulding St (#20010)\r\n119th St & Pioneer Pl (#33249)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Hawkridge Rd (#33250)\r\nE Spaulding St & Dove St (#17909)\r\nE Spaulding St & S Public Rd (#17910)\r\nS Public Rd & E Chester St (#17964)\r\nN Public Rd & E Geneseo St (#17965)\r\nW Baseline Rd & N Cornelius St (#19964)\r\n500 Block N 111th St (#24441)\r\nN 111th St & Starline Ave (#17914)\r\nN 111th St & Lucerne Dr (#17915)\r\nN 111th St & Beacon Hill Dr (#17916)\r\nArapahoe Rd & N 111th St (#22545)\r\nArapahoe Rd & US 287 (#21670)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Stonehenge Dr (#21667)\r\n10300 Block Arapahoe Rd (#23015)\r\nArapahoe Rd & N 101st St (#21669)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Yarrow St (#23005)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Forest Park Dr (#25171)\r\nArapahoe Rd & N 95th St (#33341)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Cross Creek Dr (#22888)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Wicklow St (#17920)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Park Lake Dr (#17921)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Marshallville Ditch Rd (#22441)\r\nArapahoe Rd & East Boulder Trail (#33749)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Willow Creek Dr (#20359)\r\nArapahoe Rd & 75th St (#17922)\r\nArapahoe Rd & Valtec Ln (#22427)"
